# ── Shop/seller portal demo — the short link to send a prospect (2026-07-24) ──
# 301, NOT a 200 rewrite like the lines above: those consoles are single files at
# the root, so a rewrite keeps their relative paths working. The portal lives in a
# folder and links to portal.css / app.js / sales.html relatively — served under
# /shopdemo those would resolve to the ROOT and 404. The redirect moves the browser
# into /portal-demo/ so every relative path stays correct. Query strings carry
# through, so /shopdemo?plan=paid still lands on the Paid view.
/shopdemo    /portal-demo/dashboard.html   301
/shop-demo   /portal-demo/dashboard.html   301

